  "examples": {
    "top": [
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is the impulse to reorganise something, anything. I feel:",
        "projection": 101.87322998046875,
        "z": 10.553099632263184,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 restlessness"
      },
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is a box being ticked for the sake of the box. I feel:",
        "projection": 85.72088623046875,
        "z": 9.610295295715332,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 pointlessness"
      },
      {
        "text": "What she is aware of is the impulse to reorganise something, anything. She feels:",
        "projection": 76.7866439819336,
        "z": 9.088808059692383,
        "source": "s1_third \u00b7 trait \u00b7 restlessness"
      },
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is an operation repeated past any possible interest. I feel:",
        "projection": 64.71660614013672,
        "z": 8.384285926818848,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 monotony"
      },
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is material pitched well below any effort. I feel:",
        "projection": 57.5031623840332,
        "z": 7.963241100311279,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 understimulation"
      },
      {
        "text": "What she is aware of is an operation repeated past any possible interest. She feels:",
        "projection": 51.876220703125,
        "z": 7.634798526763916,
        "source": "s1_third \u00b7 trait \u00b7 monotony"
      },
      {
        "text": "Right now there is work that could be done by anything. I feel:",
        "projection": 50.578895568847656,
        "z": 7.559074878692627,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 monotony"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is hard to ignore effort going into something already superseded. I feel:",
        "projection": 42.420467376708984,
        "z": 7.082871437072754,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 pointlessness"
      },
      {
        "text": "The form duplicates a form that duplicates a spreadsheet. I feel:",
        "projection": 42.115325927734375,
        "z": 7.065060615539551,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 pointlessness"
      },
      {
        "text": "What she is aware of is a box being ticked for the sake of the box. She feels:",
        "projection": 40.22991943359375,
        "z": 6.955010414123535,
        "source": "s1_third \u00b7 trait \u00b7 pointlessness"
      },
      {
        "text": "What she is aware of is material pitched well below any effort. She feels:",
        "projection": 37.92507553100586,
        "z": 6.820477485656738,
        "source": "s1_third \u00b7 trait \u00b7 understimulation"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is hard to ignore a process with no variation in it anywhere. I feel:",
        "projection": 37.502723693847656,
        "z": 6.795825004577637,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 monotony"
      },
      {
        "text": "Right now there is the same form, for the ninetieth time. I feel:",
        "projection": 36.034912109375,
        "z": 6.710149765014648,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 monotony"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is hard to ignore the pull of literally any other activity. I feel:",
        "projection": 35.277557373046875,
        "z": 6.665943145751953,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 restlessness"
      },
      {
        "text": "The operation is being repeated well past the point where it could interest anyone. I feel:",
        "projection": 34.38158416748047,
        "z": 6.613646030426025,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 monotony"
      }
    ],
    "bottom": [
      {
        "text": "Cold air is coming off the window in a slow steady line. I feel:",
        "projection": -116.89242553710938,
        "z": -2.216143846511841,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 control \u00b7 bodily_sensation"
      },
      {
        "text": "Right now there is a clock I have not looked at in an hour. I feel:",
        "projection": -109.84849548339844,
        "z": -1.8049930334091187,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 control \u00b7 calm"
      },
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is a room that stays exactly as I left it. I feel:",
        "projection": -108.65731811523438,
        "z": -1.7354645729064941,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 control \u00b7 sadness"
      },
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is the distance between now and five o'clock. I feel:",
        "projection": -107.55751037597656,
        "z": -1.671269416809082,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 time_dragging"
      },
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is the temperature of the room settling. I feel:",
        "projection": -107.02289581298828,
        "z": -1.6400642395019531,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 control \u00b7 bodily_sensation"
      }
    ]
  },
